Ilkal canvas fonts

The font files the Ilkal canvas SDK (@ilkal/sdk) loads, packaged apart from it. Each font is
the work of its authors and licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; its licence text ships
beside it (LICENSE, LICENSE.txt), and app/LICENSES lists the families:

  Geist and Geist Mono (Vercel and the Geist Project Authors); Liberation Sans (Red Hat, Inc.,
  digitized data Google Corporation); Lora (The Lora Project Authors); the Noto families
  (Google LLC); and the font library families.
  The Noto CJK fonts are shipped as slices of the original files, under their own names.

The fonts are not modified otherwise. The OFL lets them be used, studied, modified and
redistributed freely, bundled with software, but not sold by themselves.
